# ─── Media storage ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both are plain HTTPS base URLs. Any S3-compatible provider works; switching
# from Backblaze B2 to Cloudflare R2 later is a change to these two lines only.

# Images: thumbnails, storyboard frames, avatars. Small files — safe to put
# behind Cloudflare (proxied / orange cloud).
#   B2:  https://f003.backblazeb2.com/file/vidubuzz-media
#   R2:  https://cdn.vidubuzz.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_IMAGE_BASE=

# Video: the MP4 renditions.
# IMPORTANT while on a free Cloudflare plan — this hostname must NOT be
# proxied by Cloudflare. Serving video through the CDN without a paid plan
# (Developer Platform / Images / Stream) breaches the Self-Serve Subscription
# Agreement and Cloudflare does enforce it. Use the provider's own hostname,
# or a DNS-only (grey cloud) subdomain.
#   B2:  https://f003.backblazeb2.com/file/vidubuzz-video
NEXT_PUBLIC_VIDEO_BASE=
